# Code, method docs, the Pricing Studio and its password-locked web copy (docs/). Readable studio data, raw extracts, outputs and credentials stay out of git.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!scripts/*.py
!analysis/**/*.md
!dashboard/index.html
!dashboard/studio/
!dashboard/studio/index.html
!dashboard/studio/studio.css
!dashboard/studio/studio.js
!dashboard/studio/fresmart_logo.png
!dashboard/d3.min.js
!docs/**
!/README.md
!/.gitattributes

# never commit
.env
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.bak.*
